**PairwiseBalancedDesign n** is a structure with:
- `blocks`: a finite set of finite subsets of {1,...,n}
- `blocks_subset`: each block ⊆ {1,...,n}
- `blocks_size`: each block has 2 ≤ |A| < n
- `covers_pairs`: every pair {x,y} appears in exactly one block

**HasLargeBlocks D k**: all blocks have size ≥ k.
